We have the following meetings scheduled:
5/30
6/13 
6/27
7/11

We are moving the 5/30 meeting to 6/6. We are canceling the 6/13 phonce 
conference because of the Linux Foundation Summit. Ira wants to know if we 
should shift our meeting permanently. It seems to me that if we leave the 
schedule as is except to move the 5/30 meeting to 6/6, then it will all 
work out. Otherwise, if we shift it we will run into the July 4th US 
holiday.
6/6 (moved from 5/30)
6/13 (phone conference will be replaced by Linux Foundation Summit)
6/27
7/11

Claudia

